# Forms and validation

## Stack

- **`react-hook-form`** + **`zod`** + **`@hookform/resolvers`** for non-trivial forms.
- Simple one-off dialogs: controlled state in controller is OK (see fleet add-vehicle).

## Where logic lives

| Concern | Layer |
|---------|--------|
| Field values, submit | Controller hook or RHF in view |
| API payload shape | `domain` types + zod schema |
| HTTP | Repository → use case |
| Success/error toast | Controller `onSuccess` / `onError` |

## Reusable field chrome (brewlab-inspired)

When the same field look is repeated across features:

1. Add **`FormFieldShell`** or **`AppFormInput`** under `src/components/forms/`.
2. Props: `label`, `error`, `required`, consistent height/radius/border tokens.
3. Features use the wrapper around shadcn `Input` / `Select` — not custom `<input>` per screen.

Use unified mobile-like fields only when product/design requires parity; otherwise shadcn defaults are fine.

## Dialogs

- `Dialog` + `DialogFooter` from ui; primary submit triggers mutation from controller actions.
- Disable submit while `mutation.isPending`; show validation errors inline.

## Numbers and locales

- Parse numbers in use case or before submit; don’t send raw strings to API.
- Display dates/times with explicit locale strategy (Jalali/Gregorian helpers in `lib/` if needed).

## Accessibility

- Pair `Label` with `htmlFor` / `id`.
- Icon-only buttons need `aria-label` (see mobile menu pattern).
